# LF everywhere, on every platform. Prettier writes LF, so a Windows checkout
# converted to CRLF would fail `npm run format:check` on every file, and husky
# hook scripts with CRLF endings do not run on Linux or macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary

